    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Big up all the Monsta Island massive",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And beware before I triple dare you like the last kid",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Who asked me what we don't got that you got, son",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "For one flow that's elementary, my dear Watson",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Secondly, ever since I was little",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Not so much to riddle, least rhyme to the syllable",
          "rhyme": "abl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Keep tracks that make a Arab thief clap",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "With no hands, I chopped these drums off Truly Yours, G. Rap",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Actual fact, relax",
          "rhyme": "aks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "In this land of lyrical loss, black, I'm not the cool Sleestak",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "The one who might stop and talk to you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Poison to few, niggas who be biting styles, I'm like pork too",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Ooh, what you got to lose? Let mud fly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "When I got blues, I chew whole crews that's Bud Dry",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "So why ask why the styes from the cess",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Shit be fucking with my eye as I pull it to the chest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "The Super motherfucking Villain grip the mic with an iron hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Throwing MCs to the fire from out the frying pan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "It ain't no use in trying, man—son, stop crying",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Fronting like you death-defying, need to stop lying",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Speak your piece, only once you're spoken to first",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Now let me hear your verse while I'm choking you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "With well refined rhymes like a editor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Throw them to my collections of skulls and spines like Predator",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Fuck around, the only niggas who could hear the same sound",
          "rhyme": "awnd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "(Who?) Was Jet Jaguar and James Brown",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "(Yeah, yeah, only them two niggas?)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "And I'm glad I took the time to write their names down to big 'em up (True, true)",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "I'd like to say, \"Hi, it's Sci.Fly, the odd Merlin\"",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "That's quick to whip up a script like Rod Serling",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Who eye on bad bitch who used to whip the Sterling",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Who see God tore but never see God hurlin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "My man Grimm had his little monkey like Space Ghost",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Me myself, I got flavors that out-taste most",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "With numb gums, some rhymers is lactose",
          "rhyme": "oz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Back to you MF DOOM, you late show host (What?)",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "S to the U to the P-E-R-uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Who chronicle these times in a 3D horror (Horror)",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Thriller porno co-starrer in a realer drama",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Who break bread with stingy kin-men, Indian borrower",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Lone gunman who candidly flip fly flows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Single-handedly with one eye closed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "In a fly pose, no shirt Alayé",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "May see me stack the quarter-mill cash pay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "That's that inner smash way how he did it (Yeah, yeah, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Motherfuckers probably couldn't peep it past a minute, it's the–",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Exquisite scripts, that quick shit, go with the flow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "That's how we do it though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDDEEFGHIJKLMNOPPMHQQRSTUVPPVWWXWHQYZI[[\\]^I_",
